{L"The first stage has run out of fuel and safely separated from the rocket.", L"Birinci kademenin yak\u0131t\u0131 bitti ve roketten g\u00FCvenle ayr\u0131ld\u0131."},
{L"The protective fairing has opened, exposing the spacecraft to space.", L"Koruyucu kaporta a\u00E7\u0131ld\u0131; uzay arac\u0131 art\u0131k uzay bo\u015Flu\u011Funda."},
{L"The vehicle has successfully reached a temporary parking orbit around Earth.", L"Ara\u00E7, D\u00FCnya \u00E7evresindeki ge\u00E7ici park y\u00F6r\u00FCngesine ba\u015Far\u0131yla ula\u015Ft\u0131."},
{L"The final engine burn is complete, and the spacecraft is now coasting toward the Moon.", L"Son motor ate\u015Flemesi tamamland\u0131; uzay arac\u0131 \u015Fimdi Ay'a do\u011Fru s\u00FCz\u00FCl\u00FCyor."},
{L"The spacecraft used a small amount of fuel to perfectly adjust its aim toward the Moon.", L"Uzay arac\u0131, Ay'a y\u00F6nelimini hassas bi\u00E7imde d\u00FCzeltmek i\u00E7in az miktarda yak\u0131t kulland\u0131."},
{L"The spacecraft is firing its engine for 1.5 minutes to slow down and enter lunar orbit.", L"Uzay arac\u0131 yava\u015Flay\u0131p Ay y\u00F6r\u00FCngesine girmek i\u00E7in motorunu 1.5 dakika ate\u015Fliyor."},
{L"Success! The spacecraft has captured into a stable orbit around the Moon (LPO_100).", L"Ba\u015Far\u0131l\u0131! Uzay arac\u0131 Ay \u00E7evresinde kararl\u0131 bir y\u00F6r\u00FCngeye girdi (LPO_100)."},
{L"Success! The spacecraft has captured into a stable orbit around the Moon (ELL_30x216).", L"Ba\u015Far\u0131l\u0131! Uzay arac\u0131 Ay \u00E7evresinde kararl\u0131 bir y\u00F6r\u00FCngeye girdi (ELL_30x216)."},
{L"The spacecraft could not slow down enough and has flown past the Moon.", L"Uzay arac\u0131 yeterince yava\u015Flayamad\u0131 ve Ay'\u0131n yan\u0131ndan ge\u00E7ip gitti."},
{L"The spacecraft is passing through the Moon's shadow and is relying entirely on battery power.", L"Uzay arac\u0131 Ay'\u0131n g\u00F6lgesinden ge\u00E7iyor ve yaln\u0131zca batarya g\u00FCc\u00FCyle \u00E7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yor."},
{L"The spacecraft lost power in the Moon's shadow and contact was lost.", L"Uzay arac\u0131 Ay'\u0131n g\u00F6lgesinde g\u00FC\u00E7s\u00FCz kald\u0131 ve ba\u011Flant\u0131 koptu."},
{L"Another year complete! The spacecraft has sent 1.5 GB of science data back to Earth.", L"Bir y\u0131l daha tamamland\u0131! Uzay arac\u0131 D\u00FCnya'ya 1.5 GB bilimsel veri g\u00F6nderdi."},
{L"After 1.5 years, the spacecraft has used all its fuel and can no longer maintain its orbit.", L"1.5 y\u0131l\u0131n ard\u0131ndan uzay arac\u0131n\u0131n yak\u0131t\u0131 t\u00FCkendi; art\u0131k y\u00F6r\u00FCngesini koruyam\u0131yor."},
{L"The spacecraft reached the end of its planned 1.5-year mission and returned 2.5 GB of data.", L"Uzay arac\u0131 planlanan 1.5 y\u0131ll\u0131k g\u00F6revinin sonuna ula\u015Ft\u0131 ve 2.5 GB veri g\u00F6nderdi."},
{L"The mission has ended; review the final engineering report for your results.", L"G\u00F6rev sona erdi; sonu\u00E7lar\u0131n\u0131z i\u00E7in m\u00FChendislik raporunu inceleyin."},
