{L"The design refers to an unknown part or contains an invalid number.", L"Tasar\u0131m bilinmeyen bir par\u00E7a veya ge\u00E7ersiz bir say\u0131 i\u00E7eriyor."},
{L"Reload a valid design or replace the invalid entry.", L"Ge\u00E7erli bir tasar\u0131m y\u00FCkleyin veya hatal\u0131 girdiyi de\u011Fi\u015Ftirin."},
{L"A required piece of the vehicle is missing.", L"Arac\u0131n zorunlu bir par\u00E7as\u0131 eksik."},
{L"Add the part named in the warning.", L"Uyar\u0131da ad\u0131 ge\u00E7en par\u00E7ay\u0131 ekleyin."},
{L"There are too many parts of this type for the available mounts.", L"Bu t\u00FCrden, mevcut yuvalar\u0131n alabilece\u011Finden fazla par\u00E7a var."},
{L"Remove an extra part of this type.", L"Bu t\u00FCrden fazla olan par\u00E7ay\u0131 \u00E7\u0131kar\u0131n."},
{L"You are trying to load more propellant than the tanks can hold.", L"Tanklar\u0131n alabilece\u011Finden fazla yak\u0131t y\u00FCklemeye \u00E7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yorsunuz."},
{L"Load less propellant or increase tank capacity.", L"Daha az yak\u0131t y\u00FCkleyin veya tank kapasitesini art\u0131r\u0131n."},
{L"The fueled spacecraft is too heavy for its central frame.", L"Yak\u0131t dolu uzay arac\u0131, g\u00F6vdesinin ta\u015F\u0131yabilece\u011Finden a\u011F\u0131r."},
{L"Use a larger bus or remove mass.", L"Daha b\u00FCy\u00FCk bir g\u00F6vde kullan\u0131n veya k\u00FCtleyi azalt\u0131n."},
{L"The spacecraft has more instruments than the bus can mount.", L"Uzay arac\u0131nda g\u00F6vdenin ta\u015F\u0131yabilece\u011Finden fazla alet var."},
{L"Remove an instrument or use a larger bus.", L"Bir aleti \u00E7\u0131kar\u0131n veya daha b\u00FCy\u00FCk bir g\u00F6vde kullan\u0131n."},
{L"The computer cannot run this many instruments.", L"Bilgisayar bu kadar aleti \u00E7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131ramaz."},
{L"Remove an instrument or choose a computer that can run more.", L"Bir aleti \u00E7\u0131kar\u0131n veya daha fazla alet \u00E7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rabilen bir bilgisayar se\u00E7in."},
{L"The number of booster engines is outside this engine's allowed range.", L"Kalk\u0131\u015F motoru say\u0131s\u0131 bu motor i\u00E7in izin verilen aral\u0131\u011F\u0131n d\u0131\u015F\u0131nda."},
{L"Set the engine count within the range shown for that engine.", L"Motor say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 o motor i\u00E7in g\u00F6sterilen aral\u0131\u011Fa getirin."},
{L"The engines provide too little thrust for the rocket's liftoff mass.", L"Motorlar\u0131n itkisi roketin kalk\u0131\u015F k\u00FCtlesi i\u00E7in yetersiz."},
{L"Increase booster thrust or reduce liftoff mass.", L"Kalk\u0131\u015F itkisini art\u0131r\u0131n veya kalk\u0131\u015F k\u00FCtlesini azalt\u0131n."},
{L"The upper stage provides too little thrust for the mass it carries.", L"\u00DCst kademenin itkisi ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131 k\u00FCtle i\u00E7in yetersiz."},
{L"Choose an upper-stage engine with more thrust or reduce the mass it carries.", L"Daha y\u00FCksek itkili bir \u00FCst kademe motoru se\u00E7in veya ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131 k\u00FCtleyi azalt\u0131n."},
{L"The rocket cannot change its speed enough to reach parking orbit and send this payload toward the Moon.", L"Roket, park y\u00F6r\u00FCngesine ula\u015F\u0131p bu y\u00FCk\u00FC Ay'a g\u00F6ndermeye yetecek kadar h\u0131z de\u011Fi\u015Ftiremiyor."},
{L"Choose larger stages or more efficient engines, or lighten the spacecraft.", L"Daha b\u00FCy\u00FCk kademeler veya daha verimli motorlar se\u00E7in ya da uzay arac\u0131n\u0131 hafifletin."},
{L"The spacecraft is heavier than this fairing's payload limit.", L"Uzay arac\u0131 bu kaportan\u0131n y\u00FCk s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131ndan a\u011F\u0131r."},
{L"Choose a fairing rated for more mass or lighten the spacecraft.", L"Daha fazla k\u00FCtle ta\u015F\u0131yabilen bir kaporta se\u00E7in veya uzay arac\u0131n\u0131 hafifletin."},
{L"This fairing does not fit the selected spacecraft bus.", L"Bu kaporta se\u00E7ilen uzay arac\u0131 g\u00F6vdesine uymuyor."},
{L"Choose a fairing that fits your bus.", L"G\u00F6vdenize uyan bir kaporta se\u00E7in."},
{L"The mission costs more than the selected budget allows.", L"G\u00F6revin maliyeti se\u00E7ilen b\u00FCt\u00E7eyi a\u015F\u0131yor."},
{L"Replace expensive parts or ground services with cheaper options.", L"Pahal\u0131 par\u00E7alar\u0131 veya yer hizmetlerini daha ucuz se\u00E7eneklerle de\u011Fi\u015Ftirin."},
{L"The probe cannot change its speed enough to enter lunar orbit, so it will fly past the Moon.", L"Sonda, Ay y\u00F6r\u00FCngesine girmeye yetecek kadar h\u0131z de\u011Fi\u015Ftiremiyor; bu y\u00FCzden Ay'\u0131n yan\u0131ndan ge\u00E7ip gidecek."},
{L"Load more propellant within tank capacity, use a more efficient engine, or reduce mass.", L"Tank kapasitesi i\u00E7inde daha fazla yak\u0131t y\u00FCkleyin, daha verimli bir motor kullan\u0131n veya k\u00FCtleyi azalt\u0131n."},
{L"The probe can enter orbit, but will run out of propellant for orbit corrections before the planned mission ends.", L"Sonda y\u00F6r\u00FCngeye girebiliyor, ancak planlanan g\u00F6rev bitmeden y\u00F6r\u00FCnge d\u00FCzeltmeleri i\u00E7in yak\u0131t\u0131 t\u00FCkenecek."},
{L"Load more propellant within tank capacity or choose an orbit that needs fewer corrections.", L"Tank kapasitesi i\u00E7inde daha fazla yak\u0131t y\u00FCkleyin veya daha az d\u00FCzeltme gerektiren bir y\u00F6r\u00FCnge se\u00E7in."},
{L"The power sources cannot run the equipment and recharge the batteries, so the mission will fail when it passes through shadow.", L"G\u00FC\u00E7 kaynaklar\u0131 hem ekipman\u0131 \u00E7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131p hem bataryalar\u0131 \u015Farj edemiyor; g\u00F6rev g\u00F6lgeden ge\u00E7erken ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z olacak."},
{L"Add solar array area (or an RTG where sunlight is weak), or reduce electrical loads by removing instruments.", L"G\u00FCne\u015F paneli alan\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131n (g\u00FCne\u015F \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n zay\u0131f oldu\u011Fu yerde RTG ekleyin) veya alet \u00E7\u0131kararak elektrik y\u00FCklerini azalt\u0131n."},
{L"The batteries cannot keep the spacecraft powered through its first eclipse.", L"Bataryalar uzay arac\u0131n\u0131 ilk tutulma boyunca \u00E7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r tutam\u0131yor."},
{L"Add usable battery capacity or reduce electrical loads.", L"Kullan\u0131labilir batarya kapasitesini art\u0131r\u0131n veya elektrik y\u00FCklerini azalt\u0131n."},
{L"An instrument or antenna needs precise aiming and will be unusable without it.", L"Bir alet veya anten hassas y\u00F6nelim gerektiriyor; bu olmadan kullan\u0131lamaz."},
{L"Add a Reaction Wheel Set.", L"Bir Tepki Tekeri Seti ekleyin."},
{L"Storage fills before the next ground contact, so some data is lost.", L"Depolama bir sonraki yer ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131ndan \u00F6nce doluyor; bu y\u00FCzden bir k\u0131s\u0131m veri kaybolur."},
{L"Choose a computer with more storage or a ground network with shorter gaps.", L"Daha fazla depolamas\u0131 olan bir bilgisayar veya daha k\u0131sa aral\u0131kl\u0131 bir yer a\u011F\u0131 se\u00E7in."},
{L"The spacecraft carries no scientific instruments, so it will collect no science data.", L"Uzay arac\u0131nda bilimsel alet yok; bu y\u00FCzden bilimsel veri toplayamayacak."},
{L"Add an instrument that supports your objective.", L"Hedefinizi destekleyen bir alet ekleyin."},
{L"The main objective has no working instrument, so it cannot be completed.", L"Ana hedefin \u00E7al\u0131\u015Fan bir aleti yok; bu y\u00FCzden hedef tamamlanamaz."},
{L"Install a matching instrument or add the pointing control it requires.", L"Uygun bir alet tak\u0131n veya o aletin gerektirdi\u011Fi y\u00F6nelim kontrol\u00FCn\u00FC ekleyin."},
{L"Storage or downlink limits keep some collected data from reaching Earth.", L"Depolama veya veri indirme s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131, toplanan verinin bir k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131n D\u00FCnya'ya ula\u015Fmas\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor."},
{L"Check which limit is binding, then increase storage, downlink rate, or ground contact as needed.", L"Hangi s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131n belirleyici oldu\u011Funa bak\u0131n; ard\u0131ndan depolamay\u0131, veri indirme h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 veya yer ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131n."},
{L"A compact frame for lightweight, low-cost uncrewed probes.", L"Hafif ve d\u00FC\u015F\u00FCk maliyetli insans\u0131z sondalar i\u00E7in kompakt bir g\u00F6vde."},
{L"A larger uncrewed spacecraft frame with room for up to five instruments.", L"Be\u015F alete kadar yer sunan daha b\u00FCy\u00FCk bir insans\u0131z uzay arac\u0131 g\u00F6vdesi."},
{L"A control module reserved for future crewed missions.", L"Gelecekteki insanl\u0131 g\u00F6revler i\u00E7in ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015F bir kontrol mod\u00FCl\u00FC."},
{L"A small capsule reserved for future crewed missions.", L"Gelecekteki insanl\u0131 g\u00F6revler i\u00E7in ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015F k\u00FC\u00E7\u00FCk bir kaps\u00FCl."},
{L"Supplies air, water, and temperature control for future crewed missions.", L"Gelecekteki insanl\u0131 g\u00F6revler i\u00E7in hava, su ve s\u0131cakl\u0131k kontrol\u00FC sa\u011Flar."},
{L"A small spacecraft tank that holds up to 150 kg of propellant.", L"150 kg'a kadar yak\u0131t alan k\u00FC\u00E7\u00FCk bir uzay arac\u0131 tank\u0131."},
{L"A medium spacecraft tank that holds up to 400 kg of propellant.", L"400 kg'a kadar yak\u0131t alan orta boy bir uzay arac\u0131 tank\u0131."},
{L"A large spacecraft tank that holds up to 900 kg of propellant.", L"900 kg'a kadar yak\u0131t alan b\u00FCy\u00FCk bir uzay arac\u0131 tank\u0131."},
{L"A simpler spacecraft engine that uses propellant less efficiently than the bipropellant engine.", L"Yak\u0131t\u0131 \u00E7ift yak\u0131tl\u0131 motora g\u00F6re daha verimsiz kullanan, daha basit bir uzay arac\u0131 motoru."},
{L"A more efficient spacecraft engine that costs more than the monopropellant engine.", L"Tek yak\u0131tl\u0131 motordan daha pahal\u0131 ama daha verimli bir uzay arac\u0131 motoru."},
{L"Small thrusters that turn the spacecraft and are required on every spacecraft.", L"Uzay arac\u0131n\u0131 d\u00F6nd\u00FCren k\u00FC\u00E7\u00FCk iticiler; her uzay arac\u0131nda zorunludur."},
{L"Provide the precise aiming that some instruments and the high-gain antenna need.", L"Baz\u0131 aletlerin ve y\u00FCksek kazan\u00E7l\u0131 antenin ihtiya\u00E7 duydu\u011Fu hassas y\u00F6nelimi sa\u011Flar."},
{L"A small solar array that supplies electricity in sunlight.", L"G\u00FCne\u015F \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131nda elektrik sa\u011Flayan k\u00FC\u00E7\u00FCk bir g\u00FCne\u015F paneli."},
{L"A larger solar array that supplies more electricity in sunlight.", L"G\u00FCne\u015F \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131nda daha fazla elektrik sa\u011Flayan daha b\u00FCy\u00FCk bir g\u00FCne\u015F paneli."},
{L"A small battery that keeps spacecraft systems powered in shadow.", L"G\u00F6lgede uzay arac\u0131 sistemlerini \u00E7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r tutan k\u00FC\u00E7\u00FCk bir batarya."},
{L"A larger battery that stores more energy for time spent in shadow.", L"G\u00F6lgede ge\u00E7en s\u00FCre i\u00E7in daha fazla enerji depolayan daha b\u00FCy\u00FCk bir batarya."},
{L"Makes about 200 W from the heat of decaying plutonium, in sunlight or in shadow. Heavy and very expensive.", L"Bozunan pl\u00FCtonyumun \u0131s\u0131s\u0131ndan, g\u00FCne\u015Fte de g\u00F6lgede de yakla\u015F\u0131k 200 W \u00FCretir. A\u011F\u0131r ve \u00E7ok pahal\u0131d\u0131r."},
{L"Sends data slowly and works at any spacecraft orientation.", L"Veriyi yava\u015F g\u00F6nderir, uzay arac\u0131 hangi y\u00F6ne bakarsa baks\u0131n \u00E7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r."},
{L"Sends data at a moderate rate with coarse aiming.", L"Kaba y\u00F6nelimle orta h\u0131zda veri g\u00F6nderir."},
{L"Sends data quickly but needs a Reaction Wheel Set for precise aiming.", L"Veriyi h\u0131zl\u0131 g\u00F6nderir ama hassas y\u00F6nelim i\u00E7in Tepki Tekeri Seti gerektirir."},
{L"Runs up to two instruments and stores 16 GB of data.", L"\u0130ki alete kadar \u00E7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r ve 16 GB veri depolar."},
{L"Runs up to five instruments and stores 256 GB of data.", L"Be\u015F alete kadar \u00E7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r ve 256 GB veri depolar."},
{L"Detects hydrogen in lunar soil as a clue to possible water ice.", L"Olas\u0131 su buzuna i\u015Faret eden, Ay topra\u011F\u0131ndaki hidrojeni alg\u0131lar."},
{L"Uses laser pulses to measure terrain height, including inside shadowed craters.", L"G\u00F6lgeli kraterlerin i\u00E7i dahil, arazi y\u00FCksekli\u011Fini lazer darbeleriyle \u00F6l\u00E7er."},
{L"Measures surface temperatures to locate cold traps.", L"So\u011Fuk tuzaklar\u0131 bulmak i\u00E7in y\u00FCzey s\u0131cakl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 \u00F6l\u00E7er."},
{L"Takes detailed images of potential landing sites and generates a lot of data.", L"Olas\u0131 ini\u015F alanlar\u0131n\u0131n ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FClerini \u00E7eker ve \u00E7ok veri \u00FCretir."},
{L"Images permanently shadowed craters and uses substantial electrical power.", L"S\u00FCrekli g\u00F6lgede kalan kraterleri g\u00F6r\u00FCnt\u00FCler ve \u00E7ok elektrik harcar."},
{L"A first-stage tank that holds 200 metric tons of propellant.", L"200 ton yak\u0131t alan bir birinci kademe tank\u0131."},
{L"A larger first-stage tank that holds 285 metric tons of propellant.", L"285 ton yak\u0131t alan daha b\u00FCy\u00FCk bir birinci kademe tank\u0131."},
{L"A lower-cost booster engine that can be installed in groups of one to three.", L"Bir ila \u00FC\u00E7 adet tak\u0131labilen, d\u00FC\u015F\u00FCk maliyetli bir kalk\u0131\u015F motoru."},
{L"A higher-thrust booster engine that can be installed singly or in pairs.", L"Tek veya \u00E7ift tak\u0131labilen, y\u00FCksek itkili bir kalk\u0131\u015F motoru."},
{L"An upper-stage tank that holds 7 metric tons of propellant.", L"7 ton yak\u0131t alan bir \u00FCst kademe tank\u0131."},
{L"A larger upper-stage tank that holds 20.8 metric tons of propellant.", L"20.8 ton yak\u0131t alan daha b\u00FCy\u00FCk bir \u00FCst kademe tank\u0131."},
{L"A lower-cost upper-stage engine with moderate propellant efficiency.", L"Orta d\u00FCzeyde yak\u0131t verimlili\u011Fine sahip, d\u00FC\u015F\u00FCk maliyetli bir \u00FCst kademe motoru."},
{L"An efficient upper-stage engine with a higher cost and lower thrust.", L"Daha pahal\u0131 ve d\u00FC\u015F\u00FCk itkili ama verimli bir \u00FCst kademe motoru."},
{L"Protects Probe Bus S during launch and accepts a payload of up to 600 kg.", L"F\u0131rlatma s\u0131ras\u0131nda Sonda G\u00F6vdesi S'yi korur ve 600 kg'a kadar y\u00FCk kabul eder."},
{L"Protects larger payloads during launch and accepts a payload of up to 4,000 kg.", L"F\u0131rlatma s\u0131ras\u0131nda daha b\u00FCy\u00FCk y\u00FCkleri korur ve 4,000 kg'a kadar y\u00FCk kabul eder."},
{L"Releases a spent rocket stage or separates the spacecraft from the launcher.", L"Biten roket kademesini b\u0131rak\u0131r veya uzay arac\u0131n\u0131 f\u0131rlat\u0131c\u0131dan ay\u0131r\u0131r."},
{L"Pulls the crew capsule away from a failing rocket in future crewed missions.", L"Gelecekteki insanl\u0131 g\u00F6revlerde m\u00FCrettebat kaps\u00FCl\u00FCn\u00FC ar\u0131zal\u0131 roketten uzakla\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131r."},
